    "chunk_size_bytes": 1143,
    "chunk_text": "Sofia Colombo launches City\u2019s first multilingual \u2018Hotel E-Shop\u2019\n\nSofia Colombo has introduced Colombo\u2019s first multilingual Hotel E-Shop, developed in collaboration with Thineth Software Solutions. This innovative digital platform allows guests to instantly access the hotel\u2019s luxury services via a simple QR code scan \u2013 no app download or personal data required.\n\nThe E-Shop enables visitors and local patrons to explore and book premium offerings directly from their devices, including signature spa treatments, curated dining experiences, and exclusive souvenirs. Designed for seamless usability, the platform provides personalised recommendations, special offers, and smooth checkout.\n\nBy extending its hospitality beyond the physical premises, Sofia Colombo enhances guest convenience while supporting real-time service innovation through an integrated digital ecosystem.\n\nBrandix recognised as Green Brand of Year at SLIM Awards 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
