    "chunk_size_bytes": 1088,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank partners with WPC to offer concessional MSME loans\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank and the Western Provincial Council have signed an agreement to provide concessional loan facilities to Micro and Small Entrepreneurs in the Western Province at a low interest rate of 3%.\n\nThe signing ceremony was held recently at the Western Province Governor\u2019s Office in Battaramulla, with the participation of Western Province Governor H. M. Hanif Yusoof, Chief Secretary K. G. P. Pushpakumara, Deputy Chief Secretary (Planning) Senaka P. Silva, People\u2019s Bank Deputy General Manager \u2013 SME, Development and Micro Finance, Wickrama Narayana, Assistant General Manager (Development & Micro Finance) NalikaLiyanage, and other officials.\n\nThis partnership aims to support local entrepreneurs and strengthen economic growth across the province.\n\nSLTMOBITEL calls for public support to keep Sri Lanka connected\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
