    "md5": "5b06833d7478d2ffda4b5003ec620752",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1989,
    "chunk_text": "Unity Plaza lights up Colombo\u2019s digital future with largest triple-faced LED display\n\nLaunch marks culmination of Unity Plaza\u2019s multi-year modernisation journey, positioning it at the centre\u00a0of the nation\u2019s advancing digital future and reinforcing its role as Sri Lanka\u2019s leading technology hub\n\nColombo welcomed a new chapter in its urban landscape on 3 December as Unity Plaza revealed Sri Lanka\u2019s largest outdoor LED digital screen, drawing a distinguished audience that included the Board of Directors and the Management of On\u2019ally Holdings PLC, over 250 invitees, representatives from its international business partner and members of the media.\n\nThe unveiling signals the completion of Unity Plaza\u2019s ambitious redevelopment journey that began with its relaunch in November 2023.\n\nThe towering triple-faced display, visible from Galle Road, Wellawatta and Station Road, elevates the building into one of the most striking digital structures in the country. It strengthens Unity Plaza\u2019s prominence as the nation\u2019s leading IT hub while reshaping Colombo\u2019s commercial corridor with a contemporary visual identity.\n\nSpeaking at the launch, officials noted that the screen represents far more than an advertising platform, highlighting its role as a modern city landmark that elevates Unity Plaza\u2019s architectural presence and strengthens its position as Sri Lanka\u2019s foremost destination for technology products and services.\n\nOn\u2019ally Holdings Managing Director M.H. Jamaldeen commented on the significance of the moment by stating, \u201cThis launch is not just about lighting up Colombo\u2019s skyline. It reflects the spirit of innovation that continues to drive Unity Plaza\u2019s evolution into Sri Lanka\u2019s true IT hub. It stands as a symbol of progress, technology and national ambition.\u201d He further noted, \u201cThis installation is more than a commercial display. It is a digital landmark that connects brands, citizens and the rhythm of the city in real time.\u201d"
  },
