    "chunk_text": "On\u2019ally Holdings Managing Director M.H. Jamaldeen commented on the significance of the moment by stating, \u201cThis launch is not just about lighting up Colombo\u2019s skyline. It reflects the spirit of innovation that continues to drive Unity Plaza\u2019s evolution into Sri Lanka\u2019s true IT hub. It stands as a symbol of progress, technology and national ambition.\u201d He further noted, \u201cThis installation is more than a commercial display. It is a digital landmark that connects brands, citizens and the rhythm of the city in real time.\u201d\n\nThe launch is expected to reshape Sri Lanka\u2019s Digital Out-of-Home landscape by offering marketers and technology brands a high-visibility platform that enhances Colombo\u2019s modern identity while supporting real-time, dynamic content. It also marks the culmination of Unity Plaza\u2019s multi-year modernisation journey, positioning the building firmly at the centre of the nation\u2019s advancing digital future and reinforcing its role as Sri Lanka\u2019s leading technology hub."
