    "chunk_text": "Together, the panellists bring decades of experience in global markets, brand-building, and promoting Sri Lanka internationally. Their discussion will demonstrate how a cohesive national narrative can unlock new economic opportunities, strengthen investor confidence, and position Sri Lanka as a compelling destination for business, innovation, and skilled talent. Attendees can expect practical insights into aligning organisational messaging with national priorities, communicating purpose and credibility, and using storytelling as a competitive advantage.\n\nAttendance is open to AmCham members, corporate partners, and the wider business community, including leaders in communications, marketing, public policy, investment, and development. Pre-registration is strongly recommended, as seating will be limited to ensure a dynamic and interactive environment. This timely event promises to deliver valuable dialogue and actionable insights, helping reshape how Sri Lanka presents its story to the world and how its business community can contribute to a stronger, more unified national narrative."
