    "md5": "68950ba3334b2a1fdaa610500f94e758",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1859,
    "chunk_text": "Serendib Flour Mills recognised for excellence at National Quality Awards\n\nSerendib Flour Mills Ltd., has been recognised with a Merit Award under the Medium-Scale Manufacturing Organisations category at the Sri Lanka National Quality Awards (SLNQA) 2023, presented by the Sri Lanka Standards Institution (SLSI), held in November.\n\nSerendib Flour Mills\u2019 achievement at SLNQA 2023 reinforces the position of a trusted and progressive player in Sri Lanka\u2019s food manufacturing industry, highlighting the dedication to aligning with international best practices.\n\nSerendib Flour Mills CEO Vijay Sharma says, \u201cThe recognition is an endorsement to Serendib Flour Mills\u2019 unwavering commitment to \u2018Nourishing the nation\u2019 through continuous improvement, operational excellence, and quality leadership. Guided by a clear vision, the company has consistently invested in strengthening processes, empowering the workforce, and enhancing customer satisfaction, setting benchmarks in the manufacturing sector.\u201d\n\nSerendib Flour Mills Head of Quality Assurance Hemani Gunatilake added, \u201cThe award also mirrors the team\u2019s relentless pursuit of excellence and commitment to deliver the highest quality standards to customers. In addition, the award inspires Serendib Mills to continue to raise the bar and contribute to Sri Lanka\u2019s journey towards global competitiveness.\u201d\n\nBrand and Corporate Communications Director Kalinga Wijesekera noted, \u201cFor the past 17 years, SFML has been playing a pivotal role in the nation\u2019s food security driven by the overarching purpose of \u2018Nourishing the Nation.\u2019 SFML\u2019s commitment to excellence is evident in its utilisation of pioneering Swiss Buhler technology, enabling the delivery of the finest quality flour under the 7 Star brand, while introducing groundbreaking innovations to the Sri Lankan market.\u201d"
  },
