    "chunk_size_bytes": 2037,
    "chunk_text": "Meanings Of October 7\n\nThe strategy planners in the Washington and Tel Aviv imagined a windfall opportunity in Hamas\u2019 successful Resistance, Operation Al-Aqsa Flood, on 7 October 2023 that broke through Israel\u2019s military cordon sanitaire around the monstrous concentration camp, Gaza. They claimed the moral high ground on the back of alleged Palestinian atrocities committed during the Operation but later proved to be crude fabrications.\n\nTel Aviv threw caution to the wind; Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu ratcheted up Israel\u2019s more than 7-decades long Nakba (Catastrophe), scheming to deliver the coup de grace, the Final Solution, to the Palestine Question. He claimed victimhood and unleashed his self-declared \u201cmoral\u201d army touting the \u201cright of self-defence\u201d; and set three major goals: crush Hamas\u2019 armed resistance; shatter Hamas\u2019 civilian backbone; and either kill or drive out the Palestinians, dehumanised as \u201chuman animals\u201d by then Defence Minister Yoav Gallant (in the tradition of the German Nazis despising Jews as \u201cvermin\u201d).\n\nThe former Israeli Prime Minister Golda Meir had famously and sanctimoniously explained Jewish victimhood, \u201cWe can forgive the Arabs for killing our children, but we can never forgive them for forcing us to kill their children.\u201d Former US President Bill Clinton strongly echoed the deceitful narrative: speaking at a Kamala Harris election rally in October 2014, he maintained Israel was in the Holy Land \u201cfirst\u201d and has been \u201cforced\u201d to kill Palestinians in Gaza. (Could Clinton\u2019s alleged links to the Epstein Affair have left him vulnerable to Tel Aviv\u2019s \u201cinfluence\u201d?)\n\nHowever, October 7 and Netanyahu\u2019s genocidal aggression in its aftermath flipped the long-flogged Jews (\u201cDavid\u201d) vs. Arabs (\u201cGoliath\u201d) false narrative. They confirmed the grotesque reality well known for decades among the non-West Global Majority (87%): the combined US-NATO-Israel behemoth (\u201cGoliath\u201d) is at war against the diminutive Palestine (\u201cDavid\u201d)."
