    "chunk_size_bytes": 1925,
    "chunk_text": "Liberals often fail to grasp this nuanced view and impute a false equivalence between the violence of aggression and the violence of resistance (as in the interventions by Peace, Conflict Resolution and Policy Alternative \u201cactivists\u201d in Lanka).\n\nThe killing spree during the last 2 years (from October 7) of the relentless Nakba put to death a varyingly estimated 80,000 to 100,000 civilian Palestinians, including about 20,000 toddlers and children. Starvation of Palestinians is widely used as a weapon of war.\n\nThe Global Majority increasingly drew stunning parallels between German Nazi\u2019s holocaust in Occupied Europe and the Jewish Zionism\u2019s \u201cplausible\u2026genocide\u201d, as ruled by the International Court of Justice in January 2024, in Israeli-Occupied Gaza.\n\nTogether the US and Israel are burying International Humanitarian Laws and Geneva Conventions under the blood-drenched rubble of Gaza. Their obvious strategy is to swiftly complete the extirpation and present the physical elimination of Palestinians to the world as a fait accompli.\n\nYet the Palestinian people\u2019s determined resistance, backed by Hamas, refused to yield; they stood unbowed. Men, women, children and the aged, both Muslims and Christians, didn\u2019t abandon their homeland; they resolutely walked, crawled or dragged themselves back to their destroyed dwellings during each break in the fighting and rebuilt their homes.\n\nHamas, though damaged, is largely intact; the organization\u2019s support among the iron-willed Palestinians is undiminished, if not grown stronger. The near global revulsion of Israel\u2019s unbridled aggression and South Africa\u2019s effective legal challenge in the ICJ overwhelmingly influenced the International Criminal Court. The ICC issued arrest warrants in November, indicting Benjamin Netanyahu and (former) Defence Minister Yoav Gallant for war crimes and crimes against humanity against Palestinians in Gaza."
