    "md5": "c57a31f092e8873f1a08b4408f9db795",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1942,
    "chunk_text": "Hamas, though damaged, is largely intact; the organization\u2019s support among the iron-willed Palestinians is undiminished, if not grown stronger. The near global revulsion of Israel\u2019s unbridled aggression and South Africa\u2019s effective legal challenge in the ICJ overwhelmingly influenced the International Criminal Court. The ICC issued arrest warrants in November, indicting Benjamin Netanyahu and (former) Defence Minister Yoav Gallant for war crimes and crimes against humanity against Palestinians in Gaza.\n\nCornered and unmasked, the Collective West jettisoned the vestiges of the pretence of Rule of Law. Washington with the connivance of the rest sanctioned Francesca Paola Albanese, the widely respected UN Special Rapporteur on the occupied Palestinian territories, for exposing Israeli crimes as well as four judges of the ICC in 2025 for issuing the warrants that supposedly committed \u201ctransgressions against the United States and Israel.\u201d Every member-State in the Global Minority (13%) or Collective West, from Canada to New Zealand, acquiesced in Washington\u2019s sanctions probably because the ICC\u2019s indictment implicated their regimes, whose politicians materially enabled and/or diplomatically protected Israel\u2019s crimes. Unsurprisingly a US Senator backed the sanctions and anxiously claimed that the ICC could \u201ccome after the United States one day\u201d.\n\nThe October 7 Operation thus irretrievably shredded the Collective West\u2019s tattered civilizational fa\u00e7ade, bloodied by five centuries of colonial plunder and settler-colonial genocide in vast swathes of the lands of the Global Majority.\n\nThe Jewish Zionists\u2019 claim that Israel, the self-proclaimed bulwark of Western Civilization in West Asia, shares the same \u201cwestern values\u201d is beyond dispute. October 7 performed a historic task by shining a spotlight on the gruesome replay in Palestine of the Collective West\u2019s settler-colonialisms in real time."
