    "chunk_size_bytes": 1891,
    "chunk_text": "The Jewish Zionists\u2019 claim that Israel, the self-proclaimed bulwark of Western Civilization in West Asia, shares the same \u201cwestern values\u201d is beyond dispute. October 7 performed a historic task by shining a spotlight on the gruesome replay in Palestine of the Collective West\u2019s settler-colonialisms in real time.\n\nAbolish, they did. In the US alone Christian Zionists \u2013 the \u201cPilgrim Fathers\u201d and their descendants \u2013 led the killing en masse with a Bible in one hand and armed with a Winchester Repeater in the other while chanting they were \u201cRescuing the Land for Christ\u201d. A conservatively estimated ten million indigenous peoples, in reality many more, were murdered mostly between 1860 and 1920, barely five generations ago; it is arguably the largest genocide in modern history. Christian Zionists in the Collective West\u2019s other settler-colonies followed suit.\n\nJewish Zionists practicing the same \u201cvalues\u201d similarly slaughter Palestinians while absurdly waving the Old Testament as Israel\u2019s divinely ordained exclusive \u201ctitle deed\u201d to Palestine. (The minority of extremist Sinhalese-Buddhists may observe some similarities to Lanka here.)\n\nBenjamin Netanyahu\u2019s tailored his July 2024 address to please the descendants of White Christian Zionists warming the seats in the US Congress. Israel\u2019s illegal occupation and military aggression in Gaza, he explained, is a \u201cclash between barbarism [Palestinians] and civilization [Israel & its enablers]\u201d. That was no doubt music to the ears of the progeny of European settler-colonialists, who had similarly dehumanised the colonised indigenous peoples in the US as \u201csavages\u201d.\n\nThe adoring Netanyahu aficionadas gave almost interminable standing ovations to his racist rants and solidly backed Israel\u2019s emblematic of settler-colonialism, its land grabbing and ethnic cleansing in Occupied Palestine."
