    "chunk_text": "The adoring Netanyahu aficionadas gave almost interminable standing ovations to his racist rants and solidly backed Israel\u2019s emblematic of settler-colonialism, its land grabbing and ethnic cleansing in Occupied Palestine.\n\nThe October 7 Operation torpedoed the Abraham Accords, the stated political aim of which is to \u201cnormalise relations\u201d between Israel and key Arab countries. During Trump\u2019s first presidential term Washington had painstakingly crafted the Accords\u2019 first phase to \u201cencourage\u201d several Sunni Arab States (UAE, Bahrain, Morocco and Sudan) to fortify Israel.\n\nThe unstated strategic objectives are a) to bury Palestine\u2019s right to self-determination and b) entrench US Imperialism\u2019s vassal, Israel by enticing/coercing Arab States on Israel\u2019s border and in the immediate region to pay obeisance to Tel Aviv.\n\nHowever, Hamas\u2019 Operation Al-Aqsa Flood wrenched the Palestine Question and the right to self-determination back to centre stage; that constitutes another strategic defeat inflicted on October 7. What\u2019s more, the renewed global focus on the combined US-NATO-Israel war against Palestinians enraged most Arab peoples.\n\nThe terrified Arab rulers froze the negotiations to finalise the Abraham Accords; Saudi Arabia, hesitating on the fence, declared the establishment of a Palestinian State is a pre-condition for its participation in the Accords.\n\n*The author is an independent scholar who read for the Ph.D. degree at the University of Cambridge. He was Visiting Research Scholar at the Jawaharlal Nehru University School of International Studies and taught World History at Karachi University\u2019s Institute of Business Administration. He is an award-winning filmmaker. email: commentaries.ss@gmail.com"
