    "description": "Building a safer Sri Lanka: A presidential appeal for a National Building and Development Code",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Building-a-safer-Sri-Lanka-A-presidential-appeal-for-a-National-Building-and-Development-Code/4-785393",
