    "description": "President reviews recovery efforts in Nuwara Eliya and Badulla",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/President-reviews-recovery-efforts-in-Nuwara-Eliya-and-Badulla/56-785402",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
