    "chunk_text": "If Sri Lanka is to move forward, it must continue along this path\u2014strengthening institutions, upholding transparency, and ensuring that no future leader can exploit a national tragedy for personal ambition. Disasters will come and go. But the trust between a nation and its people must remain unshakeable. That trust, once broken in Hambantota, has begun to be restored in Thabuthegama\u2014and it must never be betrayed again."
