    "chunk_text": "Yasantha Kodagoda named Acting Chief Justice\n\nYasantha Kodagoda takes the oath as Acting Chief Justice before President Anura Kumara Dissanayake (right)\n\nPresident Anura Kumara Dissanayake has appointed Supreme Court Justice and President\u2019s Counsel Yasantha Kodagoda as Acting Chief Justice.\n\nThe appointment was made at the Presidential Secretariat and follows Chief Justice Preethi Padman Surasena\u2019s departure on official overseas travel, the President\u2019s Media Division said."
