    "description": "UK announces \u00a3 1 m in humanitarian support for cyclone-affected communities in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/UK-announces-1-m-in-humanitarian-support-for-cyclone-affected-communities-in-Sri-Lanka/56-785447",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
