    "description": "Sumanthiran flags claim that early warning on Cyclone Ditwah went unheeded",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sumanthiran-flags-claim-that-early-warning-on-Cyclone-Ditwah-went-unheeded/56-785460",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
