    "chunk_text": "Ex-Pack Corrugated Cartons PLC received a Merit Award for its consistent commitment to sustainability and responsible manufacturing. As a Carbon Neutral and WRAP-certified company, Ex-Pack has embedded ESG principles into its operations, setting a benchmark for environmentally conscious manufacturing in Sri Lanka\u2019s packaging sector. The award was accepted by Azhar Sheriff, Head of Compliance and Sustainability of Ex-Pack Corrugated Cartons, marking another milestone in the company\u2019s journey toward a more sustainable future.\n\nTogether, these honours reflect the values that define Aberdeen Holdings, where sustainability, innovation, and ethical leadership form the foundation of every business within its diversified portfolio. The recognition of Neptune Papers, Ex-Pack Corrugated Cartons, and Ruhunu Farms is not only a celebration of corporate excellence but also a reaffirmation of Aberdeen\u2019s commitment to driving purposeful growth strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s journey toward a cleaner, greener, and more sustainable future.\n\nSeylan Bank ATMs deliver customer ease with option to withdraw cash in preferred currency mixes\n\nBrandix Apparel named Overall Winner at CIPM Great HR Awards 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
