    "description": "How Sri Lankan workplace culture allows fraud to thrive \u2014 and what we can do about it",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/How-Sri-Lankan-workplace-culture-allows-fraud-to-thrive-and-what-we-can-do-about-it/4-785485",
    "lang": "en",
