    "chunk_text": "Sophos launches Authorized Training Center in Colombo in partnership with Sinetcom\n\nNew facility aims to strengthen cybersecurity skills and empower IT professionals across Sri Lanka\n\nSophos, a global leader in innovative security solutions for defeating cyberattacks, announced the launch of its new Authorized Training Center (ATC) in partnership with Sinetcom (Pvt) Ltd., a leading cybersecurity solutions provider in Sri Lanka. The new training facility, located in Colombo, marks Sophos\u2019 continued investment in building local cybersecurity capacity and supporting its partners and customers with hands-on learning opportunities.\n\nThe Sophos ATC program is a global initiative that enables select partners, distributors, and accredited organizations to deliver official Sophos training and certification courses. The program helps IT professionals gain advanced skills, enhance partner capabilities, and ensure organizations can confidently deploy and manage Sophos\u2019 cutting-edge cybersecurity technologies.\n\n\u201cWith the launch of our ATC in Colombo, we are reinforcing our commitment to strengthening cybersecurity expertise in Sri Lanka and the wider South Asian region\u201d.\n\nChildFund Sri Lanka mobilizes emergency response as catastrophic floods displace over 1.1 million\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
