    "chunk_text": "The centrepiece of IMM\u2019s award-winning transformation is its revolutionary all-in-one dashboard \u2013 a powerful, unified platform that allows organisations to monitor their own performance alongside every competitor in their sector in real time.\n\n\u2022 Real-time ad verification across TV and radio \u2013 pay only for what actually airs\n\n\u2022 Comprehensive social media & electronic media tracking in Sinhala, Tamil, and English\n\nStarting at just LKR 20,000 per month, this proudly Sri Lankan solution is now the most advanced, accessible, and cost-effective media intelligence platform in the country. (IMM)\n\nSophos launches Authorized Training Center in Colombo in partnership with Sinetcom\n\nCabinet approves establishment of two 50 MW wind power stations in Mullikulum, Mannar region\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
