    "description": "AKD says Sri Lanka remains grateful for support extended by US and other friendly nations",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/AKD-says-Sri-Lanka-remains-grateful-for-support-extended-by-US-and-other-friendly-nations/56-785550",
