    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka pavilion gains prominent attention at Productronica 2025 in Germany\n\nThe Sri Lanka Export Development Board (EDB), in collaboration with the Sri Lanka Embassy in Berlin, Germany, has organised Sri Lanka\u2019s participation at Productronica 2025 which was held from 18\u201321 November 2025 at the Messe M\u00fcnchen Trade Fair Center in the Messestadt Riem, Germany. The EDB has earlier organised a Sri Lanka Pavilion at Productronica in 2019 for the first time.\n\nProductronica 2025 Messe M\u00fcnchen is a World\u2019s leading Biennial Trade Fair with Innovative Solutions and products for the entire value chain in Electronics and Electrical Manufacturing. Productronica 2025 was a highly successful event, with over 1,600 exhibitors from 52 countries participated and demonstrated a robust and upbeat industry despite recent challenges. Key outcomes included a significant increase in exhibitors and international visitors, with over 47,000 attendees from nearly 100 countries. Productronica also celebrated its 50th anniversary in 2025.\n\nSri Lankan participating companies as exhibitors included Excel Tech Ltd., Dynexis Ltd., ICONIC Devices Ltd., Mega Heaters Ltd., Micro Electric International Ltd., and Micro Power Engineering Ltd., representing the Electronic and Electrical Manufacturing sector.\n\nThe Sri Lanka Pavilion\u2019s distinctive and inventive product line and appeal drew a lot of interest from international buyers and visitors generating numerous business inquiries and new market opportunities. The 2025 participation further strengthened Sri Lanka\u2019s Electronic and Electrical Manufacturing sector presence in the EU market and beyond, enhancing visibility for high-quality Sri Lankan products and reinforcing the island\u2019s image as a reliable sourcing destination for premium goods.\n\nThe Minister Counsellor (Commercial) of the Sri Lankan Embassy in Berlin, Germany, welcomed and encouraged the Sri Lankan exhibitors at the pavilion."
