    "chunk_size_bytes": 1719,
    "chunk_text": "Browns\u2019 General Trading honours outstanding dealer excellence\n\nBrowns General Trading recently recognised the exceptional efforts of its valued dealer network in the Colombo region in promoting its portfolio of leading global brands; Makita, Eclipse, Tailin, JK, Firman, Juba and Lion. The event saw a gathering of over 150 dealers, serving as a platform to honour excellence in performance, fortify connections and reaffirm Browns\u2019 long-term commitment to fostering its dealer ecosystem.\n\nThe evening featured prestigious awards and gifts that were presented to key performers across several categories, acknowledging their dedication and valued contribution to Browns\u2019 General Trading\u2019s growth, while serving as an inspirational night for all.\n\nSpeaking on the event, Ruwan Kodisinghe, Head of Operations \u2013 Browns General Trading said, \u201cOur dealer sales staff are the backbone of GTD\u2019s success. Their commitment, energy, and passion for our brands continue to elevate our performance and strengthen our presence across the market. This convention is our way of honouring their contribution and reaffirming our promise to support them with the right tools, training, and opportunities. Together, we look forward to achieving even greater milestones in the coming year.\u201d\n\nIn the last year, Browns\u2019 General Trading has expanded its dealer footprint considerably, enhanced its brand visibility and introduced innovative new product lines as part of its marketing strategy while focusing on sustainable dealer development. The dealer emphasises Browns\u2019 promise to invest in its most valuable stakeholders, its dealers, strengthen connections and reinforce the values of the company\u2019s 150-year legacy."
  },
