    "chunk_text": "DFCC Credit & Debit Cards introduce practical savings and flexible support for year-end spending\n\nDFCC Bank has introduced a range of practical credit and debit card benefits designed to ease financial pressure while still giving families the chance to experience the season\u2019s warmth. With up to 70% savings across supermarkets, healthcare, education, retail, and online services, DFCC Credit and Debit Cards aim to help customers manage essential spending with stability, flexibility, and a touch of cheer amidst a challenging period.\n\nFor many households, year-end expenses tend to rise across both necessities and small seasonal moments. DFCC Bank\u2019s updated credit and debit card proposition supports families through meaningful savings, responsible repayment options, and stronger financial control. Customers can benefit from up to 3% cashback on everyday purchases, alongside up to 70% savings that help reduce the cost of essential and planned expenses.\n\nTo support those managing larger commitments, DFCC Credit Cards offer extended instalment plans of up to 48 months, enabling payments to be spread out in a way that suits a household\u2019s financial capacity. Balance transfer options and flexible repayment features further assist customers in navigating expenses during a typically demanding time of year.\n\nSecurity and convenience remain central to the experience. With contactless payments, enhanced fraud protection, and secure online transaction capabilities, DFCC Credit and Debit Cards are designed to offer safety and ease. The DFCC mobile banking app provides full visibility and control, allowing customers to monitor spending and manage their finances with confidence.\n\nSLTPB hosts French media tour featuring rugby legend Serge Betsen\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
