    "description": "\u201cWhen Justice Steps In: The Supreme Court Breaks the Cycle of Ragging Impunity\u201d",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/when-justice-steps-in-the-supreme-court-breaks-the-cycle-of-ragging-impunity/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
