    "description": "The \u201cRajadurai Amendment\u201d: How  President JR Jayewardene  Amended his new  Constitution  Enabling  TULF Batticaloa  MP C. Rajadurai to Cross Over from the Opposition  and   Join the   UNP Govt.",
