    "chunk_text": "Sysco LABS wins double honours at Presidential Export Awards\n\nSysco LABS secured two top accolades at Sri Lanka\u2019s Presidential Export Awards 2024/25. It was named \u2018ICT Exporter of the Year\u2019 for a fourth consecutive year and also won \u2018Innovative Export Service of the Year\u2019 for SAGE, its enterprise AI platform built in Colombo.\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister, these prestigious awards recognize exceptional contributions to national exports. The wins underscore the company\u2019s leadership in technology exports and its innovative capabilities.\n\nManaging Director Thushera Kawdawatta stated the awards validate the team\u2019s economic impact through foreign revenue and high-value employment, highlighting world-class ingenuity from Sri Lankan talent.\n\nAs the Global Innovation Centre for Sysco, the world\u2019s leading foodservice company, Sysco LABS develops critical digital systems supporting its global operations.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
