    "chunk_size_bytes": 1398,
    "chunk_text": "Prime Group launches integrated property technology ecosystem\n\nPrime Group has established itself as the definitive digital leader in Sri Lankan real estate by launching the nation\u2019s first fully integrated property technology ecosystem. This strategic, multi-year digital transformation has redefined the ownership experience through seamless, sector-first innovations.\n\nThe Group\u2019s distinction lies in its holistic platform, which integrates pioneering solutions across the customer journey. Key innovations include the industry-exclusive\u00a01322 hotline, a fintech partnership with\u00a0DFCC Bank\u2019s iConnect\u00a0for paperless transactions, and the\u00a0Prime Edge\u00a0mobile application for end-to-end portfolio management. Further enhancing accessibility are AI-driven tools like\u00a0Prime Bee\u00a0and smart building management systems.\n\nBy unifying procurement, construction, project management, and customer workflows into a single secure ecosystem, Prime Group sets new industry benchmarks for operational excellence, transparency, and customer-centricity. This comprehensive digital infrastructure positions the company not merely as a developer, but as a technology-driven architect of modern property experience.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
