    "chunk_text": "Melwa enhancing professional competencies of construction tradesmen\n\nAddressing a critical shortage of skilled personnel, Melwa is enhancing the professional competencies of construction tradesmen. The leading steel manufacturer recently conducted a specialized workshop in Jaffna for over 100 masons and welders, providing crucial training on the correct use of reinforcement bars and GI pipes.\n\nThis initiative directly tackles the industry\u2019s skills gap by educating workers on essential technologies and best practices. In recognition of their participation, all attendees received a certificate and a valuable tool kit from the company. Furthermore, Melwa is funding comprehensive training for a selected group to achieve the prestigious NVQ Level 3 National Certificate, significantly uplifting workforce capabilities.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
