    "chunk_text": "Lakbima Rice Mills donates Rs. 100 m to \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund\n\nLakbima Rice Mills Ltd. has contributed Rs. 100 million to the Government\u2019s \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund, established to provide relief to communities affected by Cyclone Ditwa. The donation cheque was handed over at the Presidential Secretariat to Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake by Araliya Group Chairman Dudley Sirisena."
