    "description": "Learn a lesson from the disaster; Build back better with decentralisation",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Learn-a-lesson-from-the-disaster-Build-back-better-with-decentralisation/4-785668",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
