    "description": "Unsung Heroes Of The Central Bank: Computer Programmer N.M. Jayasekera",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/unsung-heroes-of-the-central-bank-computer-programmer-n-m-jayasekera/",
