    "md5": "664117e6938689a3131ef84e7917a42c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1193,
    "chunk_text": "A Classic Christmas\n\nA Classic Christmas with Billy & Devashrie, which was originally scheduled for 6th December, and postponed, will now be held this coming Sunday, 21st December.\n\nThe venue remains the same \u2013 Musaeus College Auditorium \u2013 and the action will commence at 7.00 pm\n\nThe organisers say that tickets sold for the originally date are valid for the new date, and the reserved seats remain the same \u2014 no action required if you plan to attend.\n\nHowever, due to unavoidable circumstances you cannot attend and would like a refund, you are requested to email to: bfeshowbiz@gmail.com or call 0773 619090.\n\nThe organisers also indicated that profits from this concert will be utilised for helping families affected by the recent floods.\n\nA Classic Christmas will bring into the spotlight Billy Fernando and Devashrie de Silva together with a lineup of some versatile leading musicians, along with feature spots by 2FORTY2, the Methodist College Choir, and an all-girl vocal ensemble MAYA.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
