    "md5": "af6d5d6b4db6fa94408ace1408461246",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1842,
    "chunk_text": "Lankem Agro unveils eco-friendly fertiliser solutions for sustainable farming future\n\nLankem Managing Director Suren Goonewardene (right) presenting the first invoice consignment to Kasie Chemical Vavuniya Owner and Dealer Kasinathan Kowsikan\n\nLankem Agro, has announced the launch of three breakthrough fertiliser innovations, Vovo K Power, Wonder K, and N-Shield Dual Urea marking a significant advancement in sustainable and efficient crop nutrition.\n\nThese next-generation solutions reinforce the company\u2019s purpose of nurturing growth, enriching lives, and empowering farmers through scientifically driven, practical technologies designed to enhance productivity while protecting soil health.\n\nVovo K Power represents a fourth-generation high-potassium granular fertiliser, formulated with a balanced NPK 10:05:25 ratio and enriched with ten bio-active components. Suitable for paddy, maize, fruits, and vegetables, it offers farmers versatile application options from granular use to foliar, drip, or drone applications, helping achieve higher yields, improved crop quality, and enhanced soil vitality. Wonder K, a high-potassium foliar fertiliser imported from Ukraine, combines 2% Boron and 15% Sulfur in a fully water-soluble formulation. It is particularly effective for maize and vegetable cultivation, delivering rapid and visible improvements during the flowering and grain-filling stages, strengthening crop uniformity and resilience under stress conditions. N-Shield Dual Urea introduces a new standard in nitrogen efficiency through the use of urease and nitrification inhibitors. This technology enables farmers to reduce the use of traditional urea by up to 40% while maintaining or increasing yields, significantly minimising nitrogen losses, safeguarding groundwater, and promoting long-term environmental sustainability."
