    "description": "India delivers fresh relief as Army Field Hospital concludes mission in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/India-delivers-fresh-relief-as-Army-Field-Hospital-concludes-mission-in-Sri-Lanka/56-785696",
    "lang": "en",
