    "description": "CHEC South Asia & Southeast Asia completes emergency clearing of A5 highway after Cyclone Ditwah",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/CHEC-South-Asia-Southeast-Asia-completes-emergency-clearing-of-A5-highway-after-Cyclone-Ditwah/34-785726",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
