    "description": "Not a moment to lose: Why Sri Lanka must mobilise its monetary and fiscal capacity",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Not-a-moment-to-lose-Why-Sri-Lanka-must-mobilise-its-monetary-and-fiscal-capacity/4-785747",
