    "chunk_text": "LAUGFS Rubber clinches Silver at NCPC Awards 2025 for cleaner production excellence\n\nLAUGFS Rubber, a subsidiary of LAUGFS Holdings, has been recognised with the Silver Award in the Rubber Industry sector under the large category at the National Cleaner Production Awards (NCPC) 2025, which stands as the highest recognition awarded within the sector this year. This prestigious national honour reaffirms the company\u2019s leadership in sustainable and environmentally responsible manufacturing in Sri Lanka, underscoring its ongoing commitment to minimising environmental impact, enhancing operational efficiency, and promoting cleaner production practices across the industry.\n\nThis honour reflects LAUGFS Rubber\u2019s unwavering commitment to driving resource-efficient operations at its Horana manufacturing facility, where eco-friendly processes, continuous resource tracking, and energy-saving initiatives have been embedded to meet evolving sustainability standards.\n\nLAUGFS Rubber Director \u2013 Chief Executive Officer Chinthaka Wegapitiya said, \u201cWe are truly honoured to receive the Silver Award at the NCPC Awards 2025. This recognition strengthens our commitment to sustainability and responsible manufacturing. At LAUGFS Rubber, we remain dedicated to innovating and improving our environmental performance, ensuring that our operations contribute positively to both the industry and the nation\u2019s sustainability goals.\u201d"
  },
